\f0\b0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Those were the words Chip Stockwell remembered clearest of all among the analyses and reports of the Rotherhithe Stasis Collapse. If fewer people had turned left at the burnt sofa, then quake-trance and its emerging geo-composers would never have become so popular; and later, the subculture would never have come so commercialised and corrupted that core devotees packed up the Ark of the three Gyges discs called \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker and left the American south-west for Goa. Quake-trance  would never have mutated\'97from shaking dry desert floors, occasionally flipping Kombi vans and chipping the faces of rock cliffs\'97to wet-quake-trance that shook Goa\'92s \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 groundwater, estuarine mud, and iron- and aluminium rich soil, all of which absorbed so much Gyges energy that coherence, when it finally came, would be catastrophic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Johnny had no idea what he was playing with; increased stability of the machinery invited stretching limits; smoother running facilitated more discs, which generated greater coherence commensurate with the number of resonating configurations the discs could simultaneously engage in. For five discs, that equated to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 10 pairs + 10 trios + 5 quartets + 1 quintet = 26 resonant configurations.\
Then those configurations reinforced each other, which produced 26
\fs18 \super 25
\fs22 \nosupersub  times the coherence which, if we can coax our artificial mediocrity to reliably perform arithmetic, is:\
236,773,830,007,967,588,876,795,164,938,469,376 times normal levels of coherence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 While the theory of a Big Crunch inevitably answering the Big Bang was discredited centuries earlier\'97and the universe would instead suffer a slow, lonely heat-death without comfy socks\'97that didn\'92t preclude the universe\'92s untimely end, in childhood or adolescence, due to car-crash, recreational drug misadventure, or slippery universal kitchen floor. All it needed was an event that dialled coherence back up to pre-Bang levels\'97not that Chip knew that, nor could conceive of it during even his most pessimistic of cold showers, in which he realised that the universe was made of incoherence, and everyone should just get used to it.\
No one should be turning left at the burnt sofa.\
Regrettably, Johnny was ever more determined to drive the 26-seater Kombi van.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 \'93Let\'92s all just go back to bed,\'94 Chip pleaded, which, with his usual demeanour, sounded like a bingo caller getting their knuckles crushed between the crank and the stand.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Johnny had leapt to his chance to sit at Sarah\'92s station. \'93Eloise\'92s orders were clear.\'94\
\'93Ms Jacobson is opposed. I am opposed.\'94\
\'93I don\'92t recall Eloise reinstating either of you. Dr Ortolan, set your speed to \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 4800 rpm, please.\'94 \
Ortolan stared Johnny down then rolled his eyes. The he nodded to a technician. \'934800 rpm.\'94\
\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The wall panels lit up with panels of charts, numbers and schematics. The room gasped as one.\
\'93The beautiful!\'94\
Chap had to agree with Johnny. The new interface was user experience triumph. Though everything had moved, it all seemed to be in the right place, the fonts communicated importance, the colours beamed meaning and the layout conveyed grouping and relationships better than the old.\
The display also displayed new unfamiliar information.\
\'93What\'92s that number there?\'94 Chip asked.\
\'93I dunno,\'94 a technician answered. \'93Distance to the next FitzBurgers?\'94\
\'93What does it matter, as long as we still have everything from the old interface.\'94\
The kebabs came up to 4800 rpm quicker and more smoothly.\
\'93Our old procedures must have been overly conservative,\'94 Johnny remarked.\
Chip raised an eyebrow.\
The new interface displayed representations of the washing machine articulators with more resolution than the old.\
\'93Ready for self-orientation to CMB dipole,\'94 a technician called.\
Ortolan pointed with a fully outstretched arm. No one doubted he was correct.\
\'93Take us out,\'94 Johnny answered.\
\'93We have kebab revolution compensation,\'94 a technician said.\
Johnny smiled like a kid with an another new puppy.\
An image appeared on a wall panel of Washing Machine slewing to a new place on its azimuth track while the elliptical rail tipped.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

